                     LaTeX template for the Telegram group "Retos Matemáticos"
AUTHORS: Henry Díaz Bordón; José Manuel Sánchez Muñoz.
LICENSE: CC BY-SA 4.0 (Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International).
VERSION: v1.1.2

The code within this package is the one employed for the creation of the final solutions of the cha-
llenges proposed in the Telegram group "Retos Matemáticos" - with around 1400 members! -, by José
Manuel Sánchez Muñoz.

The RetoMatematico.cls class, among other characteristics, changes the dimensions of the document to
letter-format paper, the font to Palatino Linotype- through the mathpazos package -, and places de-
tails such as the ISSN and link of the group in the margins.

For a more detailed description, the user may check the package documentation and example document.